  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1/ The proposed construction of a house, would, by reason of the small size of the habitable rooms and  amenity area  fail to comply with Council Policies and Guidelines and create a substandard dwelling contrary to Policies ENV-B.1.1 and H.4.1 of the Unitary Development Plan (2001).\r\n\r\n2/ The proposed development would result in the loss of garage parking spaces, and the underprovision of parking spaces for the proposed house. This would result in a reduction in pedestrian and highway safety in this area and would be contrary to policies T.1.4, T.2.2 and T.4.4 of the Unitary Development Plan .\r\n\r\n3/The proposal would lead to a significant loss of privacy to the gardens of the occupiers of adjoining properties. It would thereby be contrary to Policies  ENV-B.1.1 and  H.4.1 of the Unitary Development Plan (2001).\r\n\r\n"
